                "title": "Floral Knob with Beaded Rose",
                "description": "The floral design of this knobset is made of many beautiful embellishments that make the Omnia 260 Floral Knob with Beaded Rose fantastic. Intricately detailed, this solid brass Floral Door Knob with Beaded Rose features beading along both the rose and the knob. Every inch of this ornate knob is dripping with an elegance that will surely add traditional glamor to your home. Available in privacy, passage, or dummy functions.\r\n",
